# Tool credentials for this skill (all OPTIONAL — never block a run).
# Bind each to a Vault item in the Designer's Environment tab.
# The skill works as pure knowledge with none bound; CLIs activate when keys are set.

# amplitude (CLI: amplitude.js)
AMPLITUDE_API_KEY
AMPLITUDE_SECRET_KEY
# ga4 (CLI: ga4.js)
#   GA4_ACCESS_TOKEN: OAuth access token — expires; refresh out-of-band
GA4_ACCESS_TOKEN
# mixpanel (CLI: mixpanel.js)
MIXPANEL_API_KEY
MIXPANEL_SECRET
MIXPANEL_TOKEN
# segment (CLI: segment.js)
SEGMENT_ACCESS_TOKEN
SEGMENT_WRITE_KEY
